# The independent witness's own storage and mirror, which belong to the
# WAREHOUSE's trust domain rather than to the database whose authority they
# witness. A restore of the accounts database must not restore the witness, so
# none of these may ever point at anything accounts can write.
#
# Provisioning remains unwired in this local composition. Empty values refuse
# startup. A native composition must supply real independently retained custody
# through its owners; an Accounts-private store or synthetic receipt is invalid.
#
# A real deployment supplies these through Codefly's configuration provider,
# against a dedicated bucket whose IAM forbids deleting or replacing anything
# under `entries/`.
POLICY_LOG_BUCKET=
# Days every entry is held under a LOCKED object retention (nobody can delete or
# replace it before then; the bucket must have object retention enabled). A
# whole number of days, at most ten years. Required with the bucket.
POLICY_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS=
POLICY_LOG_WAREHOUSE_ENDPOINT=
